  <content>
  <section><para dir="ltr">The sum of the measures of the angles of a triangle is \( 180° \). The right triangle shown has angle measures \( a \), \( b \), and \( 90° \). Which equation could model this relationship?</para>
<para dir="ltr"><figure><media alt="A right triangle with angle measures a, b, and ninety degrees."><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/7cf2f69cf667ae3426953c235aec803c4120700c"/></media></figure></para></section>
